  "Notes": [
    {
      "Text": "Security update for libosmocore",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for libosmocore fixes the following issues:\n\nChanges in libosmocore:\n\n- Update to release 1.14.2\n  * Fix buffer overflows/overreads in `bssgp_rx_paging`,\n    `parse_process_uss_req`, `osmo_dec_gcr`, `osmo_pbit2ubit`, in\n    the CBSP WRITE-REPLACE decoder, and in TLV tag logging.\n    [boo#1289028, CVE-2026-104592]\n  * iuup: Cure stack buffer-overflow rx IuUP with payload\n    larger than 1024 bytes. [boo#1289027, CVE-2026-104591]\n    [boo#1288875, CVE-2026-104597]\n  * gsm: Reject BSSMAP Encryption Information IE with no selected\n    algo or key length != 8.\n  * Resolve [boo#1289029, CVE-2026-104594]\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
    },
